---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Alex Papineau"
	description="Background, technical experience, and systems development philosophy."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-01-01')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Hello! I'm <strong>Alex Papineau</strong>, a web developer passionate about building high-performance websites, web applications, and interactive digital experiences.
	</p>

	<h2>Background & Philosophy</h2>
	<p>
		I focus on writing clean, resilient, and lightweight code. Whether developing bespoke client platforms, performant serverless backends, or exploratory canvas simulations, my goal is simplicity, speed, and clean wireframe UI.
	</p>

	<h2>Technical Focus</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Frontend:</strong> TypeScript, React, Astro, Tailwind CSS, HTML5 Canvas</li>
		<li><strong>Backend & Cloud:</strong> Node.js, Cloudflare Workers, REST/GraphQL APIs, Serverless Architecture</li>
		<li><strong>Tooling & Systems:</strong> Git, CI/CD pipelines, Vite, Unix/Linux environments</li>
		<li><strong>Interactive Computing:</strong> Cellular automata, multi-agent systems, GIS mapping</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Interested in collaborating or discussing an upcoming project? Feel free to reach out via the <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> or explore all my work on the <a href="/">Projects Page</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
